            "review_title": "Review at The Gioi Hai San 2 (Seafood World 2)",
            "review_text": "martensendavid\nMuscle Shoals, Alabama56 contributions\n0\nGet out your wallet\nOct 2023 • Couples\nThe restaurant shows $$-$$$, as price guide.\n There are a lot more dishes OVER $100, than there are under.\n\nThis seems more suited to Asian business dinners than your average dinner meal.\nStaff also show in their attitudes, you are not a priority. Where the tables with Chinese guests got bottled water and wet naps, we had to get up and ask for paper napkins.\n\nThe food was OK, but nowhere near what one would expect.\n\nHang on to your money and avoid this place.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten October 20, 2023",
