            "review_title": "Review at The Gioi Hai San 2 (Seafood World 2)",
            "review_text": "Ibosio\nVenice, Italy160 contributions\n1\nDon't miss it\nAug 2018 • Solo\nThis is simply a Jewel in Hanoi. \nDon't listen to whoever tells you that food is no good or not well cooked, etc etc etc.\nI have been there 2 times and it is the place I would go back.\nSeafood is fresh and simply amazing. \nThey do not speak much of English, but they will try to help you as much as they can. \nIt is not a fancy restaurant, but a place where you enjoy a basic, but very good service. \n...and incredible value for money!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten September 9, 2018",
