            "review_title": "Review at The Gioi Hai San 2 (Seafood World 2)",
            "review_text": "G C\nAnchorage, Alaska966 contributions\n0\nOne of the better Hai San (seafood) restaurants I've eaten at in Ha Noi :))\nJun 2015 • Solo\nThe Gioi Hai San 2 seafood is one of those live seafood restaurants that will provide you with a marvelous dining experience :)) Their immaculately clean aquaria house the best variety and abundance of fish, crustaceans, and mollusks that I have seen anywhere in Ha Noi. These of course can become your entree, which will be prepared in super tasty fashion, and promptly served by their extremely polite and courteous wait staff. (Note: many of the seafood items are sold by the kilogram, so ask your server for an approximate weight, to find out how much your selection will be prior to ordering :) There's also a wide variety of yummy appetizers, rice, and noodle dishes for folks who aren't up to consuming a delicious whole fish... This eatery also serves the biggest portions of vegetables (stir fried etc.) that I've found anywhere (and the ingredients are super fresh as well). Now, if I could only find a large group of friends to try their seafood hotspots, my culinary experience at The Gioi Hai Sand would be complete -- enjoy this delightful (and ultra-clean) restaurant :))\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten June 15, 2015",
